<title>BELGIUM: Brederode to be quoted on forward market.</title>
<headline>Brederode to be quoted on forward market.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian holding company Brederode SA said on Thursday its shares would move to the Brussels Stock Exchange's semi-continuous forward market from the cash market on March 12.</p>
<p>Brederode said it would also soon strip its reduced withholding tax &quot;VVPR&quot; shares so that their tax benefit was traded separately and liquidity of its ordinary shares would improve.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
